  <item>
    <title>vol.111_用一场八个月的罗马“假日”，打开我的人生彩蛋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6981536aa712301410cfe3f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6981536aa712301410cfe3f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 01:33:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本以为是一次悠闲的访学，却在抵达罗马的第一天在大学门口吃了个闭门羹。本期和刚回国不久的博士候选人小蔚聊了聊，这次八个月的罗马“假日”是如何彻底偏离了她的预期。</span></p><p><span>本以为是去当学生上课，没想到变成了给一屋子背景各异的学生当“外教”；而作为老中人对效率的信仰，在每周五如约而至的罢工和合上你电脑的咖啡店老板面前，变得摇摇欲坠。作为老师，见识了中国学生“沉默的优异”与欧洲学生“张扬的表达”之间那条无形的沟壑，作为老外，遇见了心软的警察、会和上你电脑的咖啡店老板，以及至今仍保持邮件往来的意大利朋友。</span></p><p><span>直到最后，罗马以一种近乎寓言的方式留下了它的印记：回国机场传送带上的狠狠一摔，让两个膝盖永远记住了这座城。</span></p><p><span>如果你也曾好奇，一段短暂的异国生活如何能同时让人松弛又紧绷、自信又自省，这期节目或许能给你不完美，但绝对真实的答案。</span></p><p><strong><span>Highlights：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">00:04:10</a> 当菜鸟“外教”遇到资深学生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">00:08:12</a> 中外学生，乖宝宝vs好奇宝宝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">00:18:26</a> 休想在意大利的咖啡店打开你的电脑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">00:21:25</a> 每周五教师罢工=合理翘班</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">00:29:11</a> 现实版博物馆奇妙夜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">00:40:19</a> “剩菜盲盒”的惊喜和惊吓</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2672">00:44:32</a> 用狠狠一摔，画上不完美的句号</span></p><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><span>洲洲（即刻@陆洲洲）</span></p><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>小蔚</span></p><p><strong><span>设备支持：</span></strong></p><p><span>Sound x Lab 声音实验室</span></p><p><strong><span>加听友群vx：</span></strong><span>luzhou517</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>Bella Ciao Ensemblel - Bella Ciao (Flute）</span></p><p><span>Angelina Mango - Che t’o dico a fa’</span></p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/11c0-audiofreehighqps/71/04/GKwRIRwNVhg7AAFSJwRkRdjM.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/4558-audiofreehighqps/D0/5C/GKwRIMANVhhqAAGFiARkRfPP.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c9e6-audiofreehighqps/EA/0A/GAqhfD0NVhhYAAMfJARkRehm.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/bc94-audiofreehighqps/38/FE/GKwRIRwNVhhKAAHxwQRkReF0.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt="">]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://jt.ximalaya.com//GKwRIMANVhj-AiDUkARkRlaK.m4a?channel=rss&amp;album_id=50225805&amp;track_id=954106980&amp;uid=89633639&amp;jt=https://aod.cos.tx.xmcdn.com/storages/4964-audiofreehighqps/FB/06/GKwRIMANVhj-AiDUkARkRlaK.m4a" length="35706000" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:30</itunes:duration>
